[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":80},"routes/item",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"item",{"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22,"_23":24,"_25":26,"_27":28,"_29":28,"_30":31,"_32":33,"_34":35,"_36":37,"_38":39,"_40":-5,"_41":-5,"_42":43,"_44":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_52":53,"_54":37,"_55":37,"_56":-5,"_57":37,"_58":59},"expiresAt",1793591188000,"id","q5v1vxau0e4lym0x3ogx6pet0","title","Chrome 156 稳定版修复 21 项安全漏洞，CVE-2026-76024 为严重级别","originalTitle","Stable Channel Update for Desktop","summary","Chrome Stable 和 Extended Stable 渠道已更新至 Windows 和 Mac 的 156.0.8078.79/.80、Linux 的 156.0.8078.79，将在未来几天至几周内推送。","reason","公告列明 Chrome 156 稳定版包含 21 项安全修复及对应 CVE，可用于核对受影响组件并安排更新。","source",{"_64":79},"links",{"_71":78},"publishedAt","2026-10-29T21:26:20.252Z","discoveredAt","2026-10-29T23:40:22.563Z","timelineAt","category","vuln","tags",[75,76,67,77],"score",70,"selected",true,"channel","news","story","x","readingMode","full","author","Daniel Yip","body",{"_59":70,"_71":-5,"_72":73,"_74":37},"outline",[],"relatedStories",[],"topics",[60,61,62],"indexable","markdownAvailable","group","hasTranslation","bodyLanguage","zh",{"_63":68,"_64":69},{"_63":66,"_64":67},{"_63":31,"_64":65},"slug","name","漏洞披露","browser","浏览器","google","Google / 谷歌","<p><span><span>适用于 Windows 和</span><span> </span><span>Mac 的稳定版与扩展稳定版渠道已更新至 156.0.8078.79/.80，</span><span>适用于 </span><span>Linux 的版本更新至 156.0.8078.79，</span><span>将在未来几天或几周内逐步推出。此版本更改的完整列表可在 <a href=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+log/156.0.8078.74..156.0.8078.80?pretty=fuller&amp;n=10000\">日志</a>中查看。</span></span></p><p><span><span>安全修复与奖励</span></span></p><p><span><span><br></span><span>注意：在大多数用户安装修复之前，漏洞详情和相关链接的访问权限可能会继续受到限制。如果该漏洞存在于其他项目同样依赖的第三方库中，而这些项目尚未修复，我们也会继续保留限制。</span><span><b><br></b></span><span>本次更新包含 </span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1223088:2-M156\"><span>21</span></a><span> 项安全修复。有关更多信息，请参阅 </span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/Home/chromium-security\"><span>Chrome 安全页面</span></a><span>。</span><span><b><br></b></span><span><br></span></span></p><p><span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/576215540\"><span>576215540</span></a><span>]</span><span> 严重 </span><span>CVE-2026-76024：MediaStream 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Xinyang Ge 于 2026-10-21 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/559780982\"><span>559780982</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76025：FileSystem 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-09-10 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/567673200\"><span>567673200</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76026：Autofill 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-09-29 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/568894475\"><span>568894475</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76027：CacheStorage 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-02 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/569012015\"><span>569012015</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76028：FileSystem 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-03 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572055997\"><span>572055997</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76029：Network 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Cristian Di Nicola (crih.exe) (https://crihexe.com) 于 2026-10-09 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572269631\"><span>572269631</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76030：FileSystem 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>huntersnot4 于 2026-10-11 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/572556403\"><span>572556403</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-76031：Input 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Arni Hardarson (Neonix Security) 于 2026-10-12 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/573264074\"><span>573264074</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119260：Frames 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-13 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574213633\"><span>574213633</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119261：Skia 中的输入验证不当。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-16 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/574660146\"><span>574660146</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119262：V8 中的输入验证不当。 </span><span>Hyeonjun Ahn (@_deayzl) 于 2026-10-17 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575143870\"><span>575143870</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119263：GarbageCollection 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Xinyang Ge 于 2026-10-18 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575150692\"><span>575150692</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119264：Dawn 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>leegn4a 于 2026-10-19 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575201795\"><span>575201795</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119265：Quota 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-19 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/575202553\"><span>575202553</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119266：Quota 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-19 报告<br></span><span>[TBD][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/576203565\"><span>576203565</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119267：DOM 中的内存损坏。 </span><span>Xinyang Ge 于 2026-10-21 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/576984708\"><span>576984708</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119268：Editing 中的整数溢出。 </span><span>Xinyang Ge 于 2026-10-23 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/577072000\"><span>577072000</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119269：Blink 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-23 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/577333729\"><span>577333729</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119270：CacheStorage 中的输入验证不当。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-24 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/577403270\"><span>577403270</span></a><span>]</span><span> 高危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119271：Skia 中的释放后重用。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-24 报告<br></span><span>[N/A][</span><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/569012543\"><span>569012543</span></a><span>]</span><span> 中危 </span><span>CVE-2026-119272：FileSystem 中的越界读取。 </span><span>Google 于 2026-10-03 报告</span><span><b><br></b></span><span>我们还要感谢在开发周期中与我们合作的所有安全研究人员，正是他们的参与帮助我们Prevent安全漏洞进入稳定渠道。</span></span></p><p><span><span>M</span></span><span>我们的许多安全漏洞都是使用 </span><a href=\"https://code.google.com/p/address-sanitizer/wiki/AddressSanitizer\"><span>AddressSanitizer</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://code.google.com/p/memory-sanitizer/wiki/MemorySanitizer\"><span>MemorySanitizer</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/developers/testing/undefinedbehaviorsanitizer\"><span>UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/developers/testing/control-flow-integrity/\"><span>Control Flow Integrity</span></a><span>、</span><a href=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/HEAD/testing/libfuzzer/README.md\"><span>libFuzzer</span></a><span> 或 </span><a href=\"https://github.com/google/afl\"><span>AFL</span></a><span> 检测到的。</span></p><p><span>想切换发布渠道？点击 </span><span><a href=\"https://www.chromium.org/getting-involved/dev-channel\">此处</a><span>了解详情。如果您发现了新问题，请通过 </span><a href=\"https://crbug.com/\">提交 bug</a><span> 告知我们。 </span><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/community\">社区帮助论坛</a><span> 也是寻求帮助或了解常见问题的好地方。</span></span></p><p><span><span>Daniel Yip</span></span></p><p><span>Google Chrome</span></p>","original","zhKind","translation","complete","漏洞","补丁","Google","http://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_02107719452.html","Chrome Releases",{"_81":82,"_83":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
